/* THE QUERY AN AGENT-OBSERVABILITY TOOL CANNOT RUN.

   The agent reported success on every incident. Did the PLATFORM recover?
   This reads the operator's own entitlement-api error stream — the same
   index the diagnosis agent was reading — and finds the incidents where
   errors kept firing AFTER the agent executed its rollback.

   Expected (release 2026.09.1): 104 incidents never settled — and every one
   of them is a rollback that silently ran twice (01_retry_storm.ppl).
   In 2026.09.2, with the idempotency key: 0.

   Silent retry -> double-executed rollback -> platform never recovered ->
   agent reported success anyway. That chain is only visible because the
   agent's traces and the platform's logs are in the same cluster.          */
source = platform-logs
| where level = 'ERROR' and phase = 'post_remediation'
| where release = '2026.09.1'
| stats count() as errors_after_remediation by incident_id
| sort - errors_after_remediation
